%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">-</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.5pt; text-indent: -18.5pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">공고 및 신청 접수       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 24. 04. 30.(</span><span style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 05. 24.(</span><span style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">금)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.5pt; text-indent: -18.5pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">서류 심사 및 이사회 심의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 24. 05. 24.(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 7</span><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">월 중</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.5pt; text-indent: -18.5pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -41.6pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">다</spa